<p>I rather liked the Exploration Log, it was great at showing just how bored (and, as a result, kinda jumpy) these guys were. The really uneventful nature of the log only reinforced it.</p>
<p>I felt the double twist at the end kind of&#8230; mixed. The first twist was quite interesting, because it only raised more questions about what, exactly, had happened. The second twist felt much less powerful, largely because it felt almost like it was trying to act against the first (and, in my opinion, better) twist.</p>
